Description: Mathematical and statistical tools for computational biology
    in drug discovery. Functions are designed for high performance. Implements
    the hierarchical fuzzy multi-linkage partitioning method proposed by
    Huang et al. (2007) <doi:10.1186/gb-2007-8-9-r183>.
